<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TABLE-Fatra CZK 34.2 mln H1 gross profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Fatra CZK 34.2 mln H1 gross profit.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six month period</p>
<p>ending June 30, 1997: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit	   34.199     vs     86.233</p>
<p> Operational profit   55.493     vs    101.762</p>
<p> Write-offs	     39.562     vs     36.252</p>
<p>Sales of own goods</p>
<p>  and services	 835.988     vs    853.907</p>
<p> Production	    957.479     vs    961.385</p>
<p> Basic capital	 598.500     vs    598.500</p>
<p> Assets		1,610.785     vs  1,625.643</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Fatra a.s., a plastics manufacturer. Results are provided by the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, +420-2-2423-0003</p>
<p>	 prague.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
</text>
